OL,3,GNEWSABike champion 'gutted' to end
OL,4,Around-world record bid
OL,5,
OL,6,FA two-time Dakar Rally champion has
OL,7,Fsaid he is "gutted" to abandon a world
OL,8,Frecord attempt to become the fastest
OL,9,Fperson to circumnavigate the globe on a
OL,10,Fmotorcycle.
OL,12,FSam Sunderland from Poole, Dorset,
OL,13,Fbegan his challenge in Greenwich,
OL,14,FLondon, on 5 September and been hoping
OL,15,Fto ride more than 18,000 miles (28,968
OL,16,Fkm) across five continents, in just 19
OL,17,Fdays.
OL,19,FBut while crossing the Australian
OL,20,Foutback, Sunderland's Triumph Tiger
OL,21,F1200 sustained damage, pushing the
OL,22,Fchallenge behind schedule.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,335,330,200,160,0,100
