OL,3,GNEWSABike champion 'gutted' to end
OL,4,Around-world record bid
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said: "Of course I'm disappointed.
OL,7,FBut I'm also proud of what we achieved,
OL,8,Fthe places we reached and the adventure
OL,9,Fwe've had over the last few weeks."
